{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in an unknown simulation, you discover a teleporter that leads to strange puzzle rooms. Within them lie Power Cells, which must be placed into Cell Collectors to unlock the way forward. Solving these puzzles is vital to restoring power to the mainframe, where the truth behind the simulation awaits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/ddfeab8e71bd3ea2aba3551a4e37caae.avif?t=1772981005\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual Perspective is a first-person puzzle game where you manipulate Power Cells using your perspective to solve spatial challenges.\u00a0Be wary of the purple\u00a0<strong>Kill Walls,\u00a0</strong>they can destroy Power Cells upon touching, forcing them to respawn where you found them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/d6b603354214beee7e7802018bafba7b.avif?t=1772981005\" width=1200 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/c02e9928ece4c40638348cdae9711f42.poster.avif?t=1772981005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/c02e9928ece4c40638348cdae9711f42.webm?t=1772981005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/c02e9928ece4c40638348cdae9711f42.mp4?t=1772981005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https